## Command

```shell
biome format --stdin-file-path Label.svelte
```

## `biome.json`

```json
{
  "javascript": { "formatter": { "semicolons": "asNeeded" } },
  "html": {
    "experimentalFullSupportEnabled": true,
    "formatter": { "enabled": true }
  }
}
```

# Input messages

```block
<script>
let label=$state(`first
  second`)
</script>

<p class = 'label'>{label}<i>!</i> <b>next</b></p>

```

# Emitted Messages

```block
<script>
let label = $state(`first
  second`)
</script>

<p class="label">{label}<i>!</i> <b>next</b></p>

```
